    "summary": "Mask of wood with carrying handle, the face painted white, the features being picked out in blue, brown and green paint. The face is surmounted by a conical &quot;hat&quot; of cloth on a fibre frame with four protruberances, the whole being painted with geometrical designs in blue, white and brown. A bushy fringe of raffia fibre is attached to both mask and hat by means of holes drilled around the rim.",
